O:Tanzania (Swahili)
N:He Is Born. A Swahili song about a birth, probably a Christmas song, given as a Tanzanian folk song by the mu-tech.org WorldTrad page. Melody is the refrain of its MIDI arrangement (the 7-bar sung introduction is left out); chords from its accompaniment. Transposed up a semitone from E to F; no second source was found.
